From b7b115f645f546d8c855373766bdb8cfb3f8d32b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Canoziia <canoziia@projectk.org>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:06:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(deepseek-v4.1): lossless SM80 TP4 decode optimizations
 (R2..R15)

Comprehensive lossless decode optimization pack for 4x 80G GA100 Pure TP4
(zero regression across prose/code/counting c=1..32 and all fixed k=1..5):

- Native SM80 kernels & dispatch:
  - dsv41_dense_mxfp8: ksplit_nobarrier & ksplit_nobarrier_swiglu (M=1..16,
    TB=1/2), fused q_a_norm+wq_b, fused shared_w13+SwiGLU, updated 126-SM table
  - dsv41_r2: hybrid det_align_v2, fast_qrope_kv_mxfp8_insert, tuned woa_marlin
    ksplit, fgta_tc_v2_m16 (unlocked for M<=16), 4-warp dsv4_topk_v2_4w_384
  - dsv4_moe: occ=5 M=4..6 W13 dynks3 + W13 c1 (M=49..127) + tuned W2 dispatch
- PCIe Gen4 collectives & Engram:
  - 3-regime push-Lamport AllReduce (OneShot M<=2, coalesced skip-local TwoShot
    M=3..15, Ring M>=16) + pipelined 4-chunk RingBroadcast for Engram (M>=16)
  - Staggered async mHC CoefficientsMma overlap (M<=8 post-fgta, M=9..16
    pre-fgta_m16, M>=17 pre-gate) + dynamic SparseMLA dispatch
- DSpark & Adaptive Policy:
  - k-aware DSpark tail slicing & num_context bucket split for num_reqs >= 8
  - Tensor-Core fused Markov argmax + lossless Fp8DraftHead (M<=80, 158 MiB/GPU)
  - Smooth-global OnlineCostModel + tightened draft_budget (1.01) & c>=16
    upgrade hysteresis passing all [5, 1, 5] recovery invariants
